  <p>Notice how we incorporated <code>description</code>, added a standard <code>telephone</code> field, and used the more precise <code>openingHoursSpecification</code> instead of just <code>openingHours</code>. This level of detail satisfies both schema validators and search engine requirements. Just as building scalable applications requires attention to detail\u2014something you see in robust frameworks like those offered by Laravel\u2014structured data implementation demands precision.</p>
